00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:07.740
But let's say I just
want to keep it.

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:14.040
Just show me the rows that I
would be keeping if I-- sorry.

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:16.650
I keep the-- no, sorry, User ID.

00:16:16.650 --> 00:16:17.550
Yeah, exactly.

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:19.087
I'm just keeping that user ID.

00:16:19.087 --> 00:16:20.670
And then, the thing
that's interesting

00:16:20.670 --> 00:16:23.220
now is I see the event
time for that user.

00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:26.010
And there's basically a
