what I was looking at.

00:56:50.300 --> 00:56:51.950
So that's the kind of--

00:56:51.950 --> 00:56:55.560
you can go beyond word matching
and people who are quite

00:56:55.560 --> 00:56:57.210
relevant for what you're doing.

00:56:57.210 --> 00:56:59.120
Another one is Translation API.

00:56:59.120 --> 00:57:01.730
I'm sure many of you have
used it as consumers.

00:57:01.730 --> 00:57:05.090
It's available as an API
to use in your products

00:57:05.090 --> 00:57:07.790
and in your data
pricing pipeline.

00:57:07.790 --> 00:57:10.850
And finally, the Natural
Language API, which takes

00:57:10.850 --> 00:57:14.630
